        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global TH1100-PUSH Push / Pull Door Paddle</b>\r\n<p>\r\nStorefront aluminum door push / pull paddle.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadlatch-body-th1103\">Global TH1103 Deadlatch</a>, <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadlatch-body-th1103\">Adams Rite 4510 Series Deadlatch</a>, or any brand of narrow stile mortise deadlatch.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Complete kits</b> are available if converting a door from a Mortise deadbolt: <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/mortise-deadlatch-conversion-kit-with-lock-cylinder-th1103-pbsc\"><b>Conversion Kit with Lock Cylinder</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/mortise-deadlatch-conversion-kit-th1103-nc\"><b>Conversion Kit with out Lock Cylinder</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/high-security-storefront-door-mortise-deadlatch-lock-sets-mul-t-lock-cylinders-th1103-pm\"><b>Conversion Kit with High Security Lock</b></a>  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Paddle is 4-way reversible</b>. Handing can easily be reversed on cam plug by removing C-clip and flipping the cam over and reinstaling C-clip.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Global TH1100-PUSH Push / Pull Door Paddle\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Paddle Material: Extruded aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Housing: Zinc alloy, black hard-coat finish</li>\r\n<li>Operating assembly: Steel mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed, 4 way field reversible</li>\r\n<li>Cam-plug included</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n<li>Available in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis storefront door push handle set package includes: Paddle arm, operating housing, binder posts, cam plug, self-adhesive decals and mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/omnia-18000-series-size.gif?v=1704442279\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"209\" alt=\"push paddle chart\">\r\n</p>\r\n<br>",
